{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255860/extras/9cd5039932dc3fd948005390ac35dfec.avif?t=1763023138\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hymer 2000</strong> is an interactive text-based puzzle game. You can converse freely with a computer named Hymer, without being confined to a fixed set of text options. The game features an open-ended search function that allows you to enter any keyword to locate conversational logs between Hymer and others. Throughout this process, you will uncover new keywords, gather clues, collect &quot;faces,&quot; and ultimately unveil the secret Hymer has been guarding before shutting it down once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255860/extras/e18cc6e9b60b0b65e4b51eee5e88cd13.poster.avif?t=1763023138\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255860/extras/e18cc6e9b60b0b65e4b51eee5e88cd13.webm?t=1763023138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255860/extras/e18cc6e9b60b0b65e4b51eee5e88cd13.mp4?t=1763023138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255860/extras/04c3ecfd7fcc06c103ab75843bb2815e.avif?t=1763023138\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open-ended conversational system free from predefined text options. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\